  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_header.webp\" alt=\"橫幅標頭\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_promo2.webp\" alt=\"Bisecthosting 橫幅\"></a></p><h2><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_overview.webp\" alt=\"概覽橫幅\"></h2><p>準備好開始屬於你自己的《馴龍高手》冒險了嗎？跳進一個充滿龍的世界，就像電影《馴龍高手》一樣！在遊戲世界中騎乘、馴服並繁殖各種龍。與牠們並肩作戰，探索地牢的最深處，或者悠閒地騎著龍欣賞日落。帶著維京武器和裝備翱翔並探索世界，隨心所欲地掠奪。在最高的火山峰頂定居，喝杯麥酒來提升自己！一切都在 <strong>Claws of Berk</strong> 中實現。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/new-berks-dawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252fnew-berks-dawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-plural-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-plural-alt\"></a></p><span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SR_HLmOQy1s?si=w83UfReiLN4lH3WV\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><h2><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_features.webp\" alt=\"特色橫幅\"></h2><ul>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>地牢</strong> - 喜歡冒險嗎？是時候挑戰一座從頂峰到最深處的複雜地牢了。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>獨特的世界生成</strong> - 悠閒地飛越高山和廣闊平原，或者掠過深海表面。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>維京人與更多</strong> - 這是什麼？你發現了一艘維京船和一個維京村莊，這個美妙的世界還能為你帶來什麼驚喜呢？</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>龍</strong> - 野生生物可能有些危險，但別擔心，這些飛行蜥蜴更喜歡吃大餐。擁有超過50種不同物種和1000多種變體，你能馴服這些壯麗生物中最小到最大的嗎？</li>\n<li><strong>還有更多內容…！</strong></li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Claws_of_Berk/BH_Claws_of_Berk_discord.webp\" alt=\"模組包 Discord\"></a></p><h3>標準免責聲明</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>如果你是遊玩此模組包的 YouTuber 或內容創作者，請在說明中放置連結指向此頁面，以便人們知道你所使用的模組包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>不允許在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上傳此模組包或任何修改版本，包括重新分發到任何其他網站。</strong> (<em>除非獲得我本人的明確許可</em>)</li>\n</ul><h2>快來看看這些精彩的影片！</h2><span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jPAlYvDd41I?si=pM9N9N6aCFY686Bx\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XZCNY00iXv8?si=IvpPY6fK1P9QncNU\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0HHccMlR5Hw?si=Y8INHtccITw2fStF\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ha7mUe6EEYE?si=ubYwNR71biA4es5H\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/R8E_eqNturI?si=cx1tv1Pbs29bS72n\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0yrkfOdBVPE?si=J4WdnEDDpkLSXsM3\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bAQK2olfPNI?si=xhUWJRK31TxUkr5X\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe width=\"410\" height=\"230\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/PiED62zs59Y?si=MYQ57nWfi-ku3BLf\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>",
